    "description": "Local-first tracker for a portfolio of AI-agent projects and their MVP statements. Speaks the aibast-agents-library project-tracker web tool's native JSON (projectTrackerData) so data round-trips via its JSON import/export. Add/update projects, set the MVP use case/description/timeline, register agents, and export a file ready to merge-import into the web tool. Data stays on this device — never in a repo or egg.",
